menu "Board support (BSP)"

config BSP_LVGL_DRAW_BUFFER_LINES
    int "LVGL draw buffer height (panel lines)"
    range 10 320
    default 40
    help
        Single DMA draw buffer in internal RAM: 240 px x lines x 2 bytes
        (40 lines = 19.2 KB). More lines mean fewer flush commands per frame
        and faster full redraws; fewer lines leave more heap. Applications
        that need the RAM lower it and measure the refresh time.

endmenu
